  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Halve the cucumber lengthwise, scrape out the seeds using a teaspoon, then thinly slice. Cut the tomatoes into 1cm chunks. Finely chop the spring onion. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313233/photos/large/prep_ingredients-e0c6e1582904f37e96386dbfab6aee4f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make masala yoghurt: Combine the yoghurt, half the masala seasoning, half the spring onion and a pinch of sugar in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313234/photos/large/make_masala_yoghurt-3fdf75126a8b963ce9f947aa031ce523.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marinate haloumi: Put the haloumi and remaining masala seasoning in a separate bowl and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313235/photos/large/marinate_haloumi-c4c802d11c95a9671d929d2fd5b29c79.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pan-fry haloumi: Heat a medium frypan over medium heat. Toast the naan, one at a time, for 1 min each side or until lightly golden. Heat 2 tsp olive oil in the same pan over medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 1 min each side or until golden. Remove from the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313236/photos/large/pan_fry_haloumi-18f1ba7a2153e2b930115efb903f73bd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Put the cucumber, tomato, remaining spring onion and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Cut each naan into 4 pieces. Divide the naan, salad and haloumi among plates, drizzle with the masala yoghurt and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313237/photos/large/serve_up-a5c5f0f5e5db832a30dc8d36df7fffb1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have some on hand, serve with lemon wedges to squeeze over the salad for extra zing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/313238/photos/large/make_it_yours-68d09bd160e62a64fab2889867e64d25.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
